  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "V2-01",
      "priority": "P2",
      "status": "needs_revision",
      "confidence": "high",
      "continuation_of": "D01",
      "clauses": [
        "R26"
      ],
      "title": "旧文案排除的匹配边界未明确，与公开共享子串输入存在歧义",
      "observation": "新的 replacement-exclusion 原子已取得明确 runtime/visual 归属，但 /questions/replacement_exclusion 要求所有不同于 replacement 的 initial strings 从 visible UI 消失。它只豁免完全相同的字段值，没有规定排除检查针对完整字段/独立文案实例，还是针对任何可见子串。公开 initial option[2].title 为 Harbor bells，replacement 为 Harbor bells — still unavailable：两字段不同，但正确的新标题仍包含旧字符串。按子串缺席解释，合规的新标题会使该原子失败；按独立完整字段解释可以通过。设计尚未固定这两种解释的边界。",
      "impact": "缺口已从缺少验收归属收敛为 oracle 判定歧义；不能在实现前批准唯一、可重复的排除性判定。此发现来自封存公开输入的字符串包含关系，未创建产品实现或注入缺陷。",
      "requested_design_revision": "明确 stale-copy 排除针对 superseded 字段/独立文案实例，并规定与合法新文案共享子串或词组时的处理；使公开共享子串输入在显示正确 replacement 且无额外旧字段时能被无歧义判定。保持新文案 presence 与 stale-copy exclusion 两个原子独立，不必改变产品代码或 hidden 输入。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": "validation/routed-forward/design/public/reference.json",
          "sha256": "5f75b421f30712bd8807faeba7e291f517272bb9c4ec6a51e27bdf85567953a3",
          "pointer": "/questions/replacement_exclusion",
          "line": 269,
          "original_excerpt": "At replaced, after inspecting the complete component, are all superseded initial title, introduction, option-title, option-detail, quietNote and footer strings absent from the visible UI whenever the corresponding replacement string differs? Identical strings are exempt; compare sealed inputs.initial and inputs.replacement. This question judges stale-copy exclusion only, not whether new copy is present."
        },
        {
          "path": "validation/routed-forward/design/public/reference.json",
          "sha256": "5f75b421f30712bd8807faeba7e291f517272bb9c4ec6a51e27bdf85567953a3",
